  "description": "Tae-Ri dreamed of living a life like one of her favorite teen drama flicks. But at 20 years old and now gearing up for college entrance exams, that life is no longer in the cards for her. Or is it? When a desperate wish for true love transports her into the teen drama \"Once Upon a One Night Mistake,\" Tae-Ri finally gets her chance to experience the passionate love life she's always fantasized about!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
